# Large RAW test fixtures are not committed. `sample.rw2` is the one committed
# fixture the decode tests depend on (see ferrolite-decode/tests/decode.rs and
# the fixture-gated tests in src/raw.rs); it stays tracked. Any other RAW (or
# sidecar / exported image) dropped here for local hands-on testing is ignored.
#
# LICENSING: some local fixtures come from Signature Edits, whose grant
# explicitly excludes compiling their photos into a redistributed collection.
# Do NOT add a tracking exception for those files. The CC0 ones (raw.pixls.us)
# would be safe to commit but are large — keep them ignored too.
#
# RAWs that rawler cannot handle live in ../raw-broken/, deliberately OUTSIDE
# this tree: `Catalog::ingest_folder` RECURSES, so a subdirectory here would
# still be swept into every ingest test (and would also be reachable by the
# "first RAW in the dir" fixture picker in tests/decode.rs).
*
!.gitignore
!sample.rw2
!FIXTURES.md
